OL,3,GNEWSAAI to help eye tests detect
OL,4,Adiabetes
OL,5,
OL,6,FAI will be used in routine eye scans as
OL,7,Fpart of a scheme to detect early signs
OL,8,Fof illnesses such as heart disease and
OL,9,Fdiabetes.
OL,11,FThe Northern Ophthalmic Research and
OL,12,FInnovation (NORI) hub at Sunderland
OL,13,FUniversity has received #12.2m from the
OL,14,Fgovernment through UK Research and
OL,15,FInnovation (UKRI) for the project in
OL,16,Fthe hope of diagnosing patients
OL,17,Fquicker.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,347,340,200,160,0,100
