OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F346A1793958971
OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSAAI to help eye tests detect
OL,4,Adiabetes
OL,5,
OL,6,FMatthew Campbell, interim pro
OL,7,Fvice-chancellor for health and
OL,8,Fco-director of NORI, said the money
OL,9,Fwould help the team develop the
OL,10,Ftechnology and take it into
OL,11,Finternational markets.
OL,13,FWhile the tool will initially focus on
OL,14,Fdiabetes and cardiovascular disease,
OL,15,Fthe approach could later be expanded to
OL,16,Fdementia and strokes.
